        "name": "Christmas Yarn 4: Blessing Star",
        "steam_appid": 4172460,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Yarn 4: Blessing Star is a festive match-3 adventure that blends 100 levels of puzzle-solving, minigames, and a heartwarming story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary Christmas star, which has brought joy to Glimmerdale for fifty years, has mysteriously disappeared! As the Player, you’ll team up with your rival to search for clues, match gems, and restore the star before Christmas is ruined. Along the way, you’ll uncover secrets, forge unlikely friendships, and experience the true magic of the holiday season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With vibrant visuals, engaging gameplay, and a story full of twists, Christmas Yarn 4 is the perfect festive match-3!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the adventure and bring back the spirit of Christmas to Glimmerdale!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 100 Festive Match-3 Levels with a variety of challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break up the match-3 action with fun and engaging minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the missing Christmas star in this heartwarming story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the magical world of Glimmerdale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match 3 gameplay that is just right - not too easy, not too hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay options can be changed anytime</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CE Edition Extras</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Additional Match-3 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 More Jigsaws</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Additional Slider Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Additional Pipe Puzzles</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Christmas Yarn 4: Blessing Star is a festive match-3 adventure that blends 100 levels of puzzle-solving, minigames, and a heartwarming story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The legendary Christmas star, which has brought joy to Glimmerdale for fifty years, has mysteriously disappeared! As the Player, you’ll team up with your rival to search for clues, match gems, and restore the star before Christmas is ruined. Along the way, you’ll uncover secrets, forge unlikely friendships, and experience the true magic of the holiday season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With vibrant visuals, engaging gameplay, and a story full of twists, Christmas Yarn 4 is the perfect festive match-3!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the adventure and bring back the spirit of Christmas to Glimmerdale!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 100 Festive Match-3 Levels with a variety of challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break up the match-3 action with fun and engaging minigames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery of the missing Christmas star in this heartwarming story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the magical world of Glimmerdale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match 3 gameplay that is just right - not too easy, not too hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay options can be changed anytime</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CE Edition Extras</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 Additional Match-3 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 More Jigsaws</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Additional Slider Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Additional Pipe Puzzles</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Unravel a Christmas mystery in Christmas Yarn 4. The town's Blessing Star is missing, and a magical thread of yarn is your only clue. Solve match-3 puzzles, discover family secrets, and expose a conspiracy. Can you find the star and save the holiday?",
